       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MBLHUD.
      * DASHBOARD HUDS ARE COBOL.
      * A HUD DISPLAYS A LINE THAT FORTRAN ALREADY REGISTERED.
      * IT DOES NOT COMPUTE THE LINE.
      * 0.743 IS A CONSTANT. THERE IS NO SETTER.
      * BAND IS A TOKEN. IT IS NOT A WIDTH.
      * NO PREVENT-GATE. NO TIMER. NO POLL.
      * FIRMWARE IS NOT THIS PROGRAM. IT IS THE STREAM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  HUD-LINE.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(9)   VALUE "REGISTER ".
           05  REG-STATE       PIC X(10)  VALUE "REGISTERED".
           05  FILLER          PIC X(7)   VALUE " COLOR ".
           05  REG-COLOR       PIC X(4)   VALUE "CYAN".
           05  FILLER          PIC X(6)   VALUE " BAND ".
           05  BAND-TOKEN      PIC X      VALUE "0".
           05  FILLER          PIC X(7)   VALUE " FLOOR ".
           05  TRUST-FLOOR     PIC 9.999  VALUE 0.743.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY HUD-LINE.
           STOP RUN.
